        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our lead product candidate, ciltacabtagene autoleucel (\"cilta-cel\" or \"LCAR- B38M\" for purposes of our LEGEND-2 trial), is a CAR-T cell therapy we are jointly developing with our strategic partner, Janssen, for the treatment of multiple myeloma (“MM”).",
